ind":"update","title":"Demo Update","summary":"The biggest update to the demo version Friends, to mark Next Fest, I’m releasing a massive update to the demo version.I’d really appreciate it if everyone who can would give it a play.Thank you so much, friends, for sticking with me! Discord","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691367","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4434040-1845383656391541","game_id":"steam-4434040","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Soon","summary":"An update for the demo of my horror game is coming soon for Steam Next Fest.I’m currently busy polishing the build ahead of the release, so I’d appreciate any feedback.If you’ve already played the demo, please share anything you noticed:• bugs or strange game behavior• moments that were confusing or awkward• issues with balance, controls, or the UI• sections that felt boring or dragged on• any ideas or improvements that could be implementedEven small observations are incredibly helpful.I want to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T15:49:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656391541","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4434040-1835236783567068","game_id":"steam-4434040","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO JUNE 15","summary":"The demo version of Unseen - Someone will be released on June 15th. Thank you all so much for waiting for the game! I sincerely hope you enjoy the demo!Discord","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-14T04:10:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783567068","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4434040-1834602721193354","game_id":"steam-4434040","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Soon.","summary":"Friends! I'm excited to announce that the demo release is coming soon!We've already entered beta testing, so the demo version won't be long in coming! Also, I'd like to take this opportunity to say a huge thank you for nearly reaching 1,000 wishlists. Thank you for waiting :3 VladisLive DevDiscord","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T09:35:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721193354","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4434040-1824644522847205","game_id":"steam-4434040","kind":"announcement","title":"Game Announcement","summary":"Friends! Our game is already in development and will be available on Steam.What to expect:Interesting gameplayUnexpected plot twistsInteractive mechanicsLong storyline: 40-50 minutesThe full release of the game will take place in the summer, thank you very much for waiting! by VladisLive Dev","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-17T10:36:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522847205","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4434040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:21Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:21Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4434040":"2026-10-26T12:29:21Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4434040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:21Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:21Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_